Open-source Superintelligence

Usage: soma <COMMAND>

Commands:
  balance    Check SOMA balance for an address
  transfer   Transfer SOMA or USDC to a recipient
  stake      Stake SOMA with a validator: add, remove, or list delegations
  status     Show network connection status, version info, and active address
  object     Query on-chain objects by owner or ID, or transfer one to a recipient
  tx         Get transaction details or execute serialized transactions
  wallet     Manage wallet addresses and keys
  env        Manage network environments (switch, add, list)
  inference  Run the inference proxy or provider server
  channel    Manage on-chain payment channels (open, settle, top-up, close)
  bridge     Soma ↔ Eth USDC bridge: initiate withdrawals, inspect the live `BridgeState`. Inbound deposits go through the Eth-side `SomaBridge.deposit(...)` call — there's no Soma-side command for that direction
  provider   Manage on-chain provider registry (register, update, show)
  offering   Manage per-(provider, model) on-chain offerings
  model      Read the protocol-config `ModelRegistry`
  validator  Manage validators (register, set gas price, commission)
  start      Start a long-running service (localnet, validator)
  network    Inspect local network configuration and validator addresses
  genesis    Bootstrap and initialize a new SOMA network
  keytool    Low-level keystore operations (generate, import, export keys)
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
